<title>EGYPT: Egypt's General Silos details results.</title>
<headline>Egypt's General Silos details results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian state's Holding Company for Rice and Flour Mills released on Wednesday detailed financial statements for its subsidiary General Silos and Storage, 40 percent of which it is offering for sale in a partial privatisation from October 28.</p>
<p>Here are the profit accounts for recent financial years and forecasts for this and the next financial year, as well as the balance sheets at the end of the years. (Note: all years end June 30, all figures in millions of pounds):</p>
<p>				 1994/5   1995/6   1996/7   1997/8</p>
<p> Net sales		  222.308  206.730  217.900  231.700</p>
<p> Costs of sales	   161.055  151.371  156.955  161.847</p>
<p> Other expenses	    46.797   41.444   43.145   44.453</p>
<p> Other revenues	    43.944   42.405   48.685   49.600</p>
<p> NET OPERATING PROFITS   58.400   56.320   66.485   75.000</p>
<p> Extraordinary revenue    1.470    6.086     --	 --</p>
<p> Capital profits	    0.593    0.079     --	 --</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses   2.525    1.644     --	 --</p>
</text>
